  unitName: Fire Pot
  unitId: 10191
  unitNumber: 306
  description: A curious creature that lives in a pot which is said to hold a power
    capable of dramatically changing the properties of fire. They're energetic and
    often cheerful, but due to their sometimes excessively high energy there are
    quite a lot of Summoners who are annoyed by them. Despite their cute appearance
    and bright personality, one must take extra caution when attempting to capture
    one as they attack fiercely when confronted. It seems they lose all of their
    energy if the horn on their head is touched.
  summonDesc: Oh, you found me!<br>Call me Fire Pot!<br>Nice to meet you!
